{title: Chhod Diya}
{artist: Arijit Singh Bazaar}
{key: A#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#m] Chhoddiya woh [G#] raasta,        Jis [F#] raaste se tum [Fm] the guzre
[A#m] Chhod diya woh [G#] raasta,        Jis [F#] raaste se tum [Fm] the guzre
[A#m] Toddiya woh [G#] aaina,        Jis [F#] aaine mein tera [Fm] aks dikhe
Main [A#m] sheher mein tere tha [F#] ghairon sa,        Mujhe [C#] apna [G#] koi na mila [A#m]
Tere lamhon [A#m] se, mere [F#] zakhmon se,        Abtoh [C#] main [G#] door chala [A#m]
[A#m] Rukh na kiya unn [G#] galiyon ka,        Jin [F#] galiyon mein teri [Fm] baatein ho
[A#m] Chhod diya woh [G#] raasta,        Jis [F#] raaste se tum [Fm] the guzre
[A#m] Main tha musafir [F#] raah ka teri,        [C#] Tujh tak mera tha [G#] daayra
[A#m] Main kabhi tha [F#] mehbar tera,        [C#] Khanabadosh main [G#] ab thehra
[F#] Khanabadosh main ab [A#m] thehra..        [A#m] Chhoota nahin unn [G#] phoolon ko
Jin [F#] phoolon mein teri [Fm] khushboo ho,        [A#m] Rooth gaya unn [G#] khwaabon se
Jin [F#] khaabon mein tera [Fm] khaab bhi ho,        [A#m] Kuchh bhi na paya [F#] maine safar me
[C#] Hoke safar ka [G#] main reh gaya,        [A#m] Kaagaz ka bo [F#] shida ghar tha
[C#] Bheegte baarish mein [G#] beh gaya,        [F#] Bheegte baarish mein [A#m] beh gaya
[A#m] Dekhun nahi uss [G#] chaandni ko,        [F#] Jis mein ke teri [Fm] perchhayi ho
[A#m] Door hoon main [G#] in hawaaon se,        [F#] Ye hawa tujhe chhoo ke bhi [Fm] aayi na ho
